"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"vimからgithubのコードレビューしたい","ts":"1615516965.003200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aH8Ya"}]},{"client_msg_id":"737c29a4-ff50-49f6-9432-ebf1b38eb751","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"terminal開いてgh pr create叩く何かを設定したらいけるのでは？","ts":"1615516709.002300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1615516718.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5da3fd0d-3f1e-4aae-8469-61a7604b6176","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`|gh pr create` って考えたけどインタラクティブだから多分ダメなのかな","ts":"1615516660.001900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=pGI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"537e2dec-6722-4605-bf97-5c701ce31258","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ゴリラさん製の gh.vim かな","ts":"1615516173.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CIXP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f9ef61f-631e-4238-96aa-0adba0603d7b","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"だれかVimからGithubにプルリクエスト作成する設定もしくはプラグイン使ってる人います？Ginaとか応用したりするとできるんですかね:thinking_face:\ngit pushしたときにGithubから返ってくる\n```remote: Create a pull request for 'feature/branch' on GitHub by visiting:```\nのURLをブラウザで開けるようにするだけでも便利そうですが。","ts":"1615516031.000800","thread_ts":"1615516031.000800","reply_count":5,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ade"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01R112096X","text":"\u003c@U01R112096X\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1615512802.498500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4241d8d9-26b9-448b-b165-8726698ebafc","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"細かい指摘になって恐縮ですが、 `translation_patterns` は一度設定すれば十分なので外側に出しちゃって大丈夫なのと、`\u0026lt;args\u0026gt;` はコマンドに引数が指定されなかったとき空になるだけでエラーにはならないので、下記ようにするとより簡潔になるかなと思いました 。\n```command! -nargs=? PR Gina browse --scheme=pr \u0026lt;args\u0026gt;\nnnoremap \u0026lt;leader\u0026gt;aw :PR\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\ncall extend(g:gina#command#browse#translation_patterns['github\\.com'][1],\n  \\ {'pr': 'https://\\1/\\2/\\3/pull/new/%c0'})```","ts":"1615530667.030300","thread_ts":"1615516031.000800","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1615530999.000000"},"parent_user_id":"US90LD360","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["US90LD360"]},{"name":"tiken","count":1,"users":["US90LD360"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r=F2x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a55fd881-5137-49bd-a3f0-2b84a0f1cf0e","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"なるほど。すごいスッキリしました。ありがとうございます！","ts":"1615533706.036000","thread_ts":"1615516031.000800","parent_user_id":"US90LD360","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"blob_tada","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DGVS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17eb6626-988f-48dc-95ad-9f58eadc64e4","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"いえいえ、よかったです :laughing:","ts":"1615534323.036300","thread_ts":"1615516031.000800","parent_user_id":"US90LD360","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+EXGO"}]}]
